  "why": "RJ-X71, pending AR-14 (suiteui/area-selection): Design's catalog has no select.pick, select.enter-group or transform.set until AR-14 and AT-design, so platforms is [] and the harness skips the job on both. Groups card.design's rectangle and Title text into a card by commands, picks at Title (150, 56), sets x to 140, enters the card, picks at Title (190, 56) and sets x to 150, then saves. The trap: the first pick lands on Title, so the first move pulls Title out of its card. The assertion: after the first move both layers moved 40 with the card, after the second only Title moved 10 more. The turn-on sets platforms to linux and macos.",
